flowchart TD
    subgraph Host / Test Runner (100% zkvm-test-runner)
        ELF["Guest Test ELF"] --> OBJ["object / rustc-demangle<br/>(Extract function boundaries from .symtab)"]
        OBJ --> SYMTAB["Function Symbol Range Map<br/>[start, start + size) -> Symbol"]

        EXEC_CALL{"Execution Mode"}
        EXEC_CALL -- "Standard / --instructions" --> PROVER["Stock SP1 ProverClient<br/>(p.execute)"]
        PROVER --> REPORT["Stock ExecutionReport<br/>- opcode_counts (exact per-opcode dynamic cycles)<br/>- syscall_counts (hardware precompiles)<br/>- total cycles & gas"]
        REPORT --> INSTR_TABLE["Instruction Breakdown Display<br/>(ALU, MulDiv, Memory, Control, System)"]

        EXEC_CALL -- "--profile (Trace Mining)" --> TRACER["Stock MinimalExecutorRunner + TracingVMEnum<br/>(Replays trace chunks via public SP1 API)"]
        TRACER --> EVENTS["ExecutionRecord Events<br/>(add, mul, mem_load, mem_store, branch, jal, jalr)<br/>Each event has clk, pc, opcode"]

        EVENTS --> MAPPER["Trace Event Attribution Engine<br/>Matches event.pc -> Function Symbol<br/>Categorizes opcode -> Math / Mem / Branch"]
        SYMTAB --> MAPPER

        MAPPER --> PROF_TABLE["Function Profile Telemetry<br/>- Top functions by cycle count<br/>- Invocations & Avg cycles/call<br/>- Per-function Memory vs Math vs Branch breakdown<br/>- Optional filtering & baseline regression gates"]
    end